This crate is a clean-room Rust reimplementation of the VOWL visual notation
defined by the WebVOWL project. No upstream source, fixtures or assets are
vendored here, but WebVOWL is the origin of the notation and of the ontology
JSON shape this crate reads and writes, and its licence notice is retained
below in full.

The encoder half derives from VisionClaw crates/vault/src/build/ngg1.rs at
commit 1044b0722, relocated into ontomark-compile and then into this crate.
